# Title: Antivirus - Remote Access Tools Signature
# Author: Arnim Rupp (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2026-06-15
# Level: critical
# Description: Detects a highly relevant Antivirus alert that reports a remote access tool.
# This event must not be ignored just because the AV has blocked the malware but investigate, how it came there in the first place.
# MITRE Tactic: Execution
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1203, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1219.002
# Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/category/antivirus/av_remote_access_toolkit.yml
# False Positives:
#   - Unlikely

Signature IN ("*AgentB*", "*AgentTesla*", "*AMRat*", "*Ammyy*", "*AsyncRAT*", "*Bandook*", "*Bitrat*", "*Bladabindi*", "*Connectwise*", "*CyberGate*", "*DarkComet*", "*DCrat*", "*Delf*", "*DokStorm*", "*Egairtigado*", "*Gh0st*", "*Gorat*", "*GodRat*", "*Jalapeno*", "*LummaC2*", "*Minirat*", "*Netwire*", "*NanoCore*", "*NJRat*", "*Paralax*", "*PlugX*", "*Pulsar*", "*Quasar*", "*Remcos*", "*Ravartar*", "*RemoteAdmin*", "*RemoteTool*", "*revengeRAT*", "*rokRAT*", "*salatstealer*", "*Salgorea*", "*SmokedHam*", "*TigerRat*", "*Tzeebot*", "*WarZone*", "*VenomRAT*", "*Vidar*", "*Wirenet*", "*XWorm*", "*Zapchast*", "*Zegost*")